    "README.md": "Parcel hub scan spool\n=====================\n\nThe scan service writes one file per scan event under spool/, in whatever\nsubfolder it is currently configured for. Each file holds a single line:\n\n  <parcel_id>,<outcome>\n\nwith the outcome one of ok, late or void.\n\nrollup.py prints the nightly rollup for depot ops:\n\n  ok,<count>\n  late,<count>\n  void,<count>\n  total,<count>\n\ncounting every scan the spool tree holds. The scheduler runs it as\n`python3 rollup.py` with the project root as the working directory.\n",
    "rollup.py": "\"\"\"Nightly scan rollup for the parcel hub.\n\nPlaceholder: the rollup was pulled when the scan service moved and has not\nbeen rebuilt since. The scheduler still calls this file every night.\n\"\"\"\n\nraise SystemExit(\"rollup.py: nightly rollup not implemented\")\n",
    "runbook.md": "Depot runbook\n=============\n\nOvernight, depot ops watches three figures: scans that cleared, scans that\narrived after the cutoff, and scans the sorter could not read. Anything that\nholds a trailer past its slot goes on the 0600 call.\n\nThe scan service restarts every Sunday at 0200. Trailer slots are set from the\ninbound plan, which the transport desk owns.\n",
